{
  "name": "Event Registration & Dynamic Ticket Dispatcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. INTAKE LAYER\n**Webhook Node (/v1/event-registration)**\n* Captures incoming attendee registration payloads via HTTP POST\n* Accepts: `full_name`, `email`, `company`, `ticket_type`\n* Configured with **Respond to Webhook** node for synchronous HTTP 200 confirmation",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-intake",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. DATA SANITIZATION & GENERATOR\n**Edit Fields Node (Set)**\n* Generates unique ticket reference code: `TKT-[TIER]-[RANDOM6]`\n* Cleanses & trims attendee name\n* Lowercases email for normalization\n* Generates ISO registration timestamp (`$now`)",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-sanitization",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Sanitization",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. PERSISTENT STORAGE\n**Google Sheets Node**\n* Appends attendee record into `Event_Registration_Master`\n* Schema: Ticket_Code, Registered_At, Attendee_Name, Attendee_Email, Company, Ticket_Type, Check_In_Status\n* Sets initial Check_In_Status to `Registered`",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. TIER ROUTING & EMAIL DISPATCH\n**IF Node + Gmail Nodes**\n* Evaluates `ticket_type` for VIP vs General Admission\n* **TRUE (VIP):** Dispatches gold-tier responsive HTML pass with Executive Lounge access code & VIP Keynote seating\n* **FALSE (General):** Dispatches standard responsive HTML pass with general session schedule",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-routing",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Tier Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. SYNCHRONOUS CLIENT CONFIRMATION\n**Respond to Webhook Node**\n* Returns instant HTTP 200 JSON payload (< 2000 ms):\n  `{\"status\": \"confirmed\", \"ticket_code\": \"TKT-...\", \"name\": \"...\"}`\n* Guarantees zero webhook timeouts to frontend submitter",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-response",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Client Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
