on.company }}</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #2e344d;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block;\">TICKET REFERENCE</span>\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fbbf24;\">{{ $('Edit Fields: Data Cleansing & Code Generation').item.json.ticket_code }}</span>\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #2e344d; text-align: right;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block;\">PASS TIER</span>\n            <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #fbbf24; color: #0f172a; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px;\">VIP ALL-ACCESS</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08) 0%, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.04) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #fbbf24; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 15px; color: #fbbf24;\">✨ Exclusive VIP Executive Privileges</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        <li><strong>Executive Lounge Access:</strong> 4th Floor Sky Lounge (Entry Code: <code style=\"color: #fbbf24; background: #222738; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">#VIP-LOUNGE-2026</code>)</li>\n        <li><strong>VIP Keynote Seating:</strong> Reserved front-row seats (Rows A–C) at Main Auditorium</li>\n        <li><strong>Private Concierge Hotline:</strong> +1 (800) 847-2663 • <a href=\"mailto:vip-concierge@techconf.org\" style=\"color: #fbbf24; text-decoration: none;\">vip-concierge@techconf.org</a></li>\n        <li><strong>Dedicated Fast